# Agent review gate

Changes made by an agent need a human review gate.

## Before you hand work back

- Give a short summary of the diff in plain words.
- List every file you touched.
- List every command you ran, and its result.
- List anything you did not test, and why.

## Limits

- Never merge, push, tag or release without explicit approval from a person.
- Never delete data, branches or files outside the task without asking.
- Never add a new dependency without asking.
- Never change security settings, secrets or access rules on your own.

## When in doubt

- Stop and ask. A short question is cheaper than a wrong change.
- Prefer a small diff the reviewer can read in one sitting.
- If the task grows, say so and propose a split.
